# The table view: i sends the types as a table to pick from, filtered as you type (so the s and
# k of "task" are text, not a sort and a move), Enter on one sends its items as the rows.
# Sorting by elevation, filtering by country, Enter opening the selected volcano's note and Ctrl-o coming back to the table as it
# was; then the eruption table's VEI chips and the task table (tests/drive.rs adds
# Inbox/Today.md, with a priority).
size 160x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys i
wait-for Table of…
expect volcano         9
expect type to filter
type volc
wait-for 1 of 4 rows · /volc
keys enter
wait-for 9 rows
expect Eyjafjallajökull  Iceland
expect elevation  tags
keys l l S
wait-for by elevation descending
expect elevation ▼
screen
keys /
type united
wait-for / united▏
expect-not Iceland
keys enter
wait-for 4 of 9 rows · /united · by elevation descending
keys g enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Mauna Loa  reading
wait-for Ctrl-o ⟵ table
keys ctrl+o
wait-for 4 of 9 rows · /united · by elevation descending
keys esc
wait-for 9 rows · by elevation descending
keys esc
wait-gone by elevation
keys i
wait-for Table of…
type erup
wait-for 1 of 4 rows · /erup
keys enter
wait-for 4 rows
expect vei  example
expect  6   [[Krakatoa]] 1883
screen
keys q i
wait-for Table of…
type task
wait-for 1 of 4 rows · /task
expect-not by type
keys enter
wait-for 6 rows
expect Ring the observatory
expect  high
screen
keys q q
exits 0
